Package: daimondstats
Title: Personal Baseball Seasons and Situational Run Value
Version: 0.0.4
Authors@R: person("Woohyun", "Kim", email = "woodenkim92@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares a personal collection of baseball games with a reference
    season through stratified resampling and evaluates verified plays using
    run expectancy. Includes MLB base-out transitions for five reviewed
    scorecards, a published run expectancy matrix, and a run impact plot.
    Also imports reviewed scorecard CSV exports and calculates
    batting statistics. Input checks reject unresolved scorecard readings,
    duplicate reference game identifiers, and unverified event rows.
